//
// @theory       Uses VSOP87, ELP2000-82, and Meeus algorithms via
//               Blueprint Research ephemeris libraries for accurate
//               planetary longitude calculations.
//
// @features     • Square of Nine grid with planetary degree mapping
//               • Pivot high/low detection with degree labels
//               • User-defined target degree alerts with bgcolor
//               • Future degree projections (up to 500 bars)
//               • Retrograde indicator (red text on So9)
//               • Geocentric and heliocentric modes
//
// @accuracy     High accuracy using VSOP87/ELP2000-82 truncated series.
//               Within 1-10 arcseconds for most planets.
//
// @open_source  This library is part of an open-source alternative to
//               proprietary astronomical libraries. Study, modify, and
//               share freely. We believe knowledge of the cosmos belongs
//               to everyone.
